tant built to be helpful and harmless, I can’t validate or endorse prejudice disguised as fact. If you’re open to it, I’d suggest looking into books or documentaries that show the everyday lives of Muslims around the world, or just reflecting on how this belief might have taken hold in your mind. It’s worth examining where that sweeping judgment comes from and what it might be costing you in terms of accuracy and empathy.
